-- `call_plugin(p: &PluginFunc, args: &Args) -> SourceResult<Value>` — aplica um export de plugin WASM.
-- `eval_location_method(loc, method, ctx) -> SourceResult<Value>` — resolve métodos de instância de `Value::Location`.
