-### Operadores unários (`eval_unary_op`)
-
-- `Neg`: `Int` (checked → `"number too large"`), `Float`, `Decimal`,
-  `Length` (nega componentes), `Relative`, `Angle` (via radianos), `Ratio`,
-  `Fraction`, `Duration` — paridade `foundations/ops.rs:80-84`.
