+## Ownership and evidence
+
+Layer: L1. Sole productive consumer:
+`01_core/src/compiler/layout/footnote_flush.rs` (lineage header at `:2`).
+The flush body at `:40`, safe boundary at `:91`, greedy fitting at `:128`
