-### Números
+Recognize braces, brackets, parentheses, dollar, comma, semicolon, colon, dot
+and simple operators. Compound operators win over their prefixes:
+`==`, `!=`, `<=`, `>=`, `+=`, `-=`, `*=`, `/=`, `..`, `=>`.
+Minus accepts ASCII hyphen and U+2212.
 
